The legislative texts and footnotes in this repository are from the Laws of Bangladesh site,
http://bdlaws.minlaw.gov.bd, published by the Legislative and Parliamentary Affairs Division, Ministry of Law,
Justice and Parliamentary Affairs, Government of Bangladesh ("Copyright © 2019, Legislative and Parliamentary
Affairs Division"). The site states no licence for reuse. The texts are reproduced without change to their wording;
only the arrangement (one file per section or Article, one paragraph per line, footnotes placed at the end of the
file that cites them) is Lexifina's.

No provision of Bangladesh law was found that excludes Acts from copyright or permits reproducing them: under the
Copyright Act, 2023, sections 2(49), 15 and 28, a work of the law-making authority is a Government work whose
copyright the Government owns for 60 years (see SOURCES.md). This repository is private; that position must be
settled before it is made public.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
